  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(121, 81, 2)\n\n(88, 54, 2)\n\n**Logic:** Third no. = [(First no. ÷ 11) - (Second no. ÷ 9)]\n\n**(121, 81, 2) →**\n\n⇒ [(121 ÷ 11) - (81 ÷ 9)]\n\n⇒ (11 - 9) = 2\n\n**(88, 54, 2) →**\n\n⇒ [(88 ÷ 11) - (54 ÷ 9)]\n\n⇒ (8 - 6) = 2\n\nChecking all the given options:\n\n**1.** (13, 5, 9)\n\n⇒ [(13 ÷ 11) - (5 ÷ 9)]\n\n⇒ (1.18 - 0.55) = 0.625\n\n**2. **(78, 6, 45)\n\n⇒ [(78 ÷ 11) - (6 ÷ 9)]\n\n⇒ (7.09 - 0.66) = 6.394\n\n**3.** (31, 56, 98)\n\n⇒ [(31 ÷ 11) - (56 ÷ 9)]\n\n⇒ (2.81 - 6.22) = (-3.41)\n\n**4. (77, 18, 5)**\n\n⇒ [(77 ÷ 11) - (18 ÷ 9)]\n\n⇒ (7 - 2) = **5**\n\nHere, **(77, 18, 5)** shows a similar relation to the given set of numbers.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option (4)\".",
